[Desktop Entry]
Type=Application
Version=1.0
Name=Better Files
Name[zh_TW]=Better Files
GenericName=File Manager
GenericName[zh_TW]=檔案管理員
Comment=Browse files and applications, with copies that survive a restart and devices that say when they are safe to unplug
Comment[zh_TW]=瀏覽檔案與應用程式，複製工作可跨重啟續行，裝置也會說明何時可以安全拔除
Exec=better-files %U
Icon=better-files
Terminal=false
StartupNotify=true
Categories=System;FileTools;FileManager;
MimeType=inode/directory;
Keywords=files;folder;manager;browser;copy;
Keywords[zh_TW]=檔案;資料夾;管理員;瀏覽;複製;
# Installing the package does not make Better Files the default file manager.
# That is the `default-file-manager` integration in the component manifest,
# applied through Better Defaults and restorable to the captured value.
